    "aboutTitle": "Unwrap Elegance.",
    "aboutText": "Cravat Cases is a Dhaka-based shop selling covers for iPhone and Google Pixel phones.\n\nWe list every cover by exact phone model, so you always get the right fit. Each order is checked before it is packed and delivered all over Bangladesh.\n\nOrdering is simple: choose your cover, send the order on WhatsApp and pay cash when it arrives.",
