    "pages": {
      "delivery": {
        "title": "Delivery information",
        "enabled": true,
        "body": "We deliver all over Bangladesh through trusted courier services.\n\n## Delivery charge\n- Inside Dhaka: ৳70\n- Outside Dhaka: ৳130\n\n## Delivery time\n- Inside Dhaka: 1–2 working days\n- Outside Dhaka: 2–4 working days\n\n## Payment\nCash on delivery is available everywhere. You can also pay by bKash or Nagad — we will share the number on WhatsApp when we confirm your order.\n\nPlease check the cover in front of the delivery person before paying."
      },
      "returns": {
        "title": "Return & exchange",
        "enabled": true,
        "body": "We want you to be happy with your cover.\n\n## Exchange\n- If you receive a wrong model, wrong colour or a damaged cover, we will exchange it free of charge.\n- Please tell us on WhatsApp within 3 days of receiving the order, with a photo.\n- The cover must be unused and in its original packaging.\n\n## Not eligible\n- Covers that have been used, scratched or damaged after delivery.\n- Change of mind after the cover has been used.\n\n## Refund\nIf we cannot exchange the product, we will refund the product price by bKash/Nagad within 3 working days."
      },
      "faq": {
        "title": "Frequently asked questions",
        "enabled": true,
        "body": "## How do I order?\nChoose your phone model and colour, then tap Order now. Your order is sent to us on WhatsApp and we confirm it by phone.\n\n## Do I need to pay in advance?\nNo. Cash on delivery is available all over Bangladesh.\n\n## How do I know the cover fits my phone?\nEvery product lists the exact phone models it fits. If you are not sure, send us your model name on WhatsApp.\n\n## How can I track my order?\nUse the Track Order page with your order number and mobile number.\n\n## Can I exchange a cover?\nYes — see our Return & exchange page."
      },
      "privacy": {
        "title": "Privacy policy",
        "enabled": true,
        "body": "We only collect the information needed to deliver your order: your name, mobile number and address.\n\n- We use it to confirm and deliver your order and to contact you about it.\n- We never sell or share your details with anyone except the courier delivering your order.\n- If you create an account, your password is stored securely (encrypted).\n- You can ask us to delete your account at any time by WhatsApp or email."
      },
      "terms": {
        "title": "Terms & conditions",
        "enabled": true,
        "body": "By placing an order on this website you agree to the following:\n\n- Prices and stock can change without notice. The price shown when you order is the price you pay.\n- An order is confirmed only after we contact you by phone or WhatsApp.\n- Product photos are for reference; the colour may look slightly different on different screens.\n- We may cancel an order if the product is out of stock or the contact details are not reachable.\n- Please see our Delivery information and Return & exchange pages for more details."
      }
    },
